            <rule name="Servo-Skull Hub" id="bfc6-f141-e23a-2158" hidden="false">
              <description>At the start of your shooting phase, choose a unit within 12&quot; of the Rhino Primaris. They gain one of the following effects (each is One Use Only): Targeting Data Skull - Fire Snap Shots at full BS. Repair Skull (vehicles only): Roll a D6. On a 2+, the vehicle regains a hull point. Vox Skull - the unit gains fearless until the start of your next turn.</description>
