      <rules>
        <rule name="Crushing Weight" id="b892-ebb7-9abe-395b" hidden="false">
          <description>The Typhon Heavy Siege Tank is densely constructed and heavily reinforced to withstand the recoil of its own main weapon. This has the side effect of enabling it to pulverize just about anything smaller than itself that crosses its path. The Typhon adds +1 to all rolls on the Thunderblitz table when making a Ram or a Tank Shock attack.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
