        <rule name="Severing Cut" id="f831-97bf-77d3-4651" hidden="false">
          <description>Each time a non-vehicle model suffers a wound, roll a D6. On a 4+, the model suffers D3 extra wounds which must be saved separately using the weapon&apos;s profile. These to not generate extra wounds.</description>
