          <description>May fire overwatch if another Ravenwing unit within 24&quot; is being assaulted. To fire a template weapon, they must be within 6&quot; of the charged friendly unit.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Support squadron" id="1e40-70b9-b4e3-8a0f" hidden="false" page="143" publicationId="578f-d512-pubN101686">
          <description>All vehicles in the formation form a single Vehicle Squadron, but count as 2 units when calculating VPs if completely destroyed.</description>
