          </costs>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Dual Void Shield Generator" id="73d0-624e-7a37-18b6" hidden="false">
              <description>Whilst the model&apos;s void shields are active, any hits scored by shooting attacks against it strike its void shields instead. The Sokar 
has two void shields, each with an Armour value of 12. A Glancing hit or Penetrating hit or any hit by a Destroyer weapon 
scored against a shield causes it to collapse. After this, further hits strike the original target instead. At the end of each of its 
controlling player&apos;s turns, roll a D6 for each collapsed shield - a roll of 5+ instantly restores it.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
